  'Pan': "聲像", 'Centre': "置中", 'Fade in': "淡入", 'Fade out': "淡出", 'Key level': "音量關鍵影格", 'Key pan': "聲像關鍵影格", 'Normalize': "標準化", 'Audio scrubbing': "音訊拖曳預聽", 'Mute track': "將軌道靜音", 'Solo track': "獨奏軌道", 'Fade In': "淡入", 'Fade Out': "淡出", 'Key Level': "音量關鍵影格", 'Key Pan': "聲像關鍵影格", 'Use Take': "使用錄音", 'Delete Take': "刪除錄音", 'Record Voice take': "錄製語音", 'Voice take': "語音錄音",
  'formmorpheus is not allowed to use the microphone. Allow microphone access for formmorpheus in your system settings (or the browser’s site settings), then press Try again.': "formmorpheus 沒有使用麥克風的權限。請在系統設定（或瀏覽器的網站設定）中允許 formmorpheus 使用麥克風，然後按「重試」。",
  'No microphone was found. Plug one in or pick another input, then press Try again.': "找不到麥克風。請接上麥克風或選擇其他輸入，然後按「重試」。",
  'The microphone is busy or unavailable: another app may be using it. Close it, then press Try again.': "麥克風忙碌中或無法使用：可能有其他 App 正在使用。請將其關閉，然後按「重試」。",
  'This page cannot reach a microphone. Recording needs the desktop app or a secure (https or localhost) page.': "此頁面無法存取麥克風。錄音需要桌面 App 或安全（https 或 localhost）頁面。",
