  'Pressure to stamp size': "壓力對應印章大小", 'Pressure to opacity': "壓力對應不透明度", 'Pressure to flow': "壓力對應流量", 'Pressure to edge softness (needs Bleed above 0)': "壓力對應邊緣柔和度(暈開需大於 0)", 'Pressure to roundness (needs Pressure roundness)': "壓力對應圓度(需要壓力圓度)", 'Lean to tilt effect': "傾斜對應傾斜效果", 'Jitter lateral': "橫向抖動", 'Jitter linear': "縱向抖動", 'Spacing jitter': "間距抖動", 'Speed spacing': "速度間距", 'Count jitter': "數量抖動", 'Pressure roundness': "壓力圓度", 'Tilt roundness': "傾斜圓度", 'Roundness jitter H': "圓度抖動 水平", 'Roundness jitter V': "圓度抖動 垂直", 'Barrel roll': "桶滾", 'Relative to stroke': "相對筆畫",
